---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
flowchart TD
    Start([vigilo run cancel])

    RunId{Run id valid?}
    RequestCancel[Mark control cancellation requested]
    Found{Run exists?}
    Status{Run status?}
    Drain[Mark control dispatch cursors drained]
    Routes[Resolve execution routes]
    CancelWork[Cancel local work and commit chunk receipts by placement]
    Summary[Refresh routed cancellation summary]
    Event[Enqueue control cancellation event]
    Payload[Build cancellation payload]

    Success([Success response])

    RunIdFail([Run id error])
    NotFoundFail([Run not found error])
    TerminalFail([Cancellation error])
    UnsupportedFail([Unsupported status error])
    PersistenceFail([Persistence error])
    OutputFail([Output write error])

    Start --> RunId

    RunId -- No --> RunIdFail
    RunId -- Yes --> RequestCancel

    RequestCancel --> Found
    RequestCancel -. Lookup fails .-> PersistenceFail

    Found -- No --> NotFoundFail
    Found -- Yes --> Status

    Status -- Completed or failed --> TerminalFail
    Status -- Already cancelled --> Drain
    Status -- Pending, running, finalizing or blob preparation --> Drain
    Status -- Other --> UnsupportedFail

    Drain --> Routes
    Drain -. Update fails .-> PersistenceFail

    Routes --> CancelWork
    Routes -. Lookup fails .-> PersistenceFail

    CancelWork --> Summary
    CancelWork -. Update fails .-> PersistenceFail

    Summary --> Event
    Summary -. Update fails .-> PersistenceFail

    Event --> Payload
    Event -. Enqueue fails .-> PersistenceFail

    Payload --> Success
    Payload -. Write fails .-> OutputFail

    class Start command
    class Success success
    class RunId,RequestCancel,Found,Status,Drain,Routes,CancelWork,Summary,Event,Payload system
    class RunIdFail,NotFoundFail,TerminalFail,UnsupportedFail,PersistenceFail,OutputFail error
